WEBVTT

NOTE
playbookId:ExamplePlaybook0000001
Language:en-US
Version:1.0.0

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
This walkthrough tours the main areas of a project.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.400
Once you are signed in, open Projects and choose a project.

3
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.000
Inside the project, the feed lists recent notes and status changes.

4
00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.240
The Files tab is where documents are kept.

5
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.480
Use the Questions list to ask the project team anything that comes up during

6
00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:35.980
your rollout.

7
00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:45.060
The Resources tab gathers useful links, help articles, and recordings of past

8
00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:45.560
meetings.

9
00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:53.480
On the Board, you can see and change your assigned work by opening My Work,

10
00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.080
choosing the task, and Edit.

11
00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:09.240
Or browse every task, grouped by phase, by choosing the board listed below.

12
00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:27.000
You can now open a project, read its feed, find files, ask questions, browse

13
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.100
resources, and update your tasks to keep the work moving.
